# INVWINPL.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the pick lists of
# the dialogs beside the item form.  Find text's search dialog takes the
# category CARD from its list by C twice (CPU first) and the location A1,
# its path shown, from the tree after its first row, (no location), and
# finds item 3.  The filter dialog, the item listing, the item labels and
# the bin labels have a list for the category and a "..." button beside
# the location: the filter's list is closed, the listing's category (its
# first code), the labels' location and the bin labels' location, after
# the row (every location), are chosen.
# Move on item 1 asks for a location, B2 chosen from the tree, and moves
# it.  Windows ends its session under the search dialog's open category
# list.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINPL.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S LIST
# Category is the third field of the search dialog, Location the fourth
K ALT-S T TAB TAB F4 C C
S SRCHCAT
K ENTER
S SRCHCOK
K TAB F4
S SRCHLOC
K DOWN DOWN ENTER
S SRCHLOK
K ENTER
S FOUND
# ESC on the results shows the search dialog again, as it was
K ESC
S BACK
K ESC
# the filter dialog opens on Category
K ALT-S F F4
S FILTCAT
K ESC
S FILTESC
K ESC ALT-R I F4 DOWN ENTER TAB F4 ESC
S REPORT
K ESC ALT-R T F4 ESC TAB F4 DOWN ENTER
S LABEL
K ESC ALT-R B F4 DOWN ENTER
S BIN
K ESC
# Record > Move asks for the location to move item 1 to
K ALT-C M
S MOVE
K F4 DOWN DOWN ENTER
S MOVEPICK
K ENTER
S MOVED
# the session ends under the search dialog's open category list
K ALT-S T TAB TAB F4
S ENDPICK
Q
S ENDED
